<title>GERMANY: Munich air passenger traffic up 4.1 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Munich air passenger traffic up 4.1 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Passenger traffic at Munich airport rose 4.1 percent in March, airport authority figures showed.</p>
<p>Demand for foreign air travel rose strongly by 8.1 percent but domestic air travel declined 2.1 percent, the monthly traffic report said.</p>
<p>The following table shows 1997 passenger details with year-on-year percentage changes.</p>
<p>		   March   Pct change    Jan-March    Pct change</p>
<p>    Total    1,382,075    Up 4.1	 3,696,485    Up  6.8</p>
<p>    Foreign    828,619    Up 8.5	 2,125,748    Up 10.1</p>
<p>    Domestic   533,130  Down 2.1	 1,514,182    Up  2.4</p>
<p>    Transit     20,326    Up 0.2	    56,555    Up  9.9</p>
<p>Source: Flughafen Muenchen GmbH market research dept.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017</p>
